#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:5 c9ef8e617cd840c9a4de2c3ba19edb0a
msgid "Live Video"
msgstr "实时视频"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:7 3ece81b2106247408d1610b67a6d35be
msgid ""
"This page explains how live video can be displayed on Mission Planner's Data"
" screen"
msgstr "本页介绍如何在 Mission Planner 的数据界面上显示实时视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:10 39e2dfaa40bf4183b41fc46123005f81
msgid "HUD"
msgstr "HUD"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:16 a499b8ae77a24b858fe4db2849e9b52e
msgid ""
"To display video from a :ref:`Herelink <common-herelink>` on the HUD please "
"follow the `CubePilot instructions <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/herelink/herelink-user-guides/share-video-stream>`__ which include:"
msgstr ""
"如需在 HUD 上显示来自 :ref:`Herelink <common-herelink>` 的视频，请参阅 `CubePilot 说明 "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/herelink/herelink-user-guides/share-"
"video-stream>`__，其中包括："

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:18 cd4b5caaaacc4dd7910d24fd2bc79f5a
msgid ""
"Ensure the camera gimbal is connected to the Herelink AirUnit's HDMI port "
"(see RTSP video instructions below if using ethernet)"
msgstr "确保摄像头云台已连接至 Herelink 空中端的 HDMI 接口（若使用以太网，请参阅下方 RTSP 视频说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:19 65ecb777f1dc498fbc9137c110c7de1d
msgid "Ensure the PC is connected to the Herelink GroundUnit's Wifi AP"
msgstr "确保 PC 已连接至 Herelink 地面端的 Wi-Fi 热点"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:20 9022077a91db4e549951cb3c53c3261b
msgid ""
"Right-mouse-button click on Mission Planner's Data screen's HUD and select "
"Video, Herelink"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 数据界面的 HUD 上单击鼠标右键，选择「Video」→「Herelink」"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:21 e6069b18786a4d0681549a95f90f5329
msgid ""
"Enter the Herelink GroundUnit's IP address which is normally 192.168.43.1"
msgstr "输入 Herelink 地面端的 IP 地址，通常为 192.168.43.1"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:23 86ad8141ce8c4d359625388f7bb369d5
msgid ""
"For non-Herelink setups, an RSTP video stream can be displayed on the HUD by"
" doing the following:"
msgstr "对于非 Herelink 的设置，可通过以下步骤在 HUD 上显示 RTSP 视频流："

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:25 67b8860981b5493faf49702b7cb049c1
msgid ""
"Right-mouse-button click on the HUD and select Video, Set GStreamer Source"
msgstr "在 HUD 上单击鼠标右键，选择「Video」→「Set GStreamer Source」"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:26 b6f3b3a47b8041bb9b4e9eaaf87f4ef2
msgid ""
"Input the GStream pipeline.  The pipeline below is known to work for the "
":ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` using IP address of "
"'192.168.144.25:8554'"
msgstr ""
"输入 GStreamer 管道。以下管道已验证可用于 :ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`，IP 地址为 "
"`192.168.144.25:8554`"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:28 ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:52
#: 489b170125d340c18494e02a23151265 6cec328160f94499826cf88462a0adbc
msgid ""
"``rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264 latency=41 udp-"
"reconnect=1 timeout=0 do-retransmission=false ! application/x-rtp ! "
"decodebin3 ! queue max-size-buffers=1 leaky=2 ! videoconvert ! "
"video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink sync=false``"
msgstr ""
"``rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264 latency=41 udp-"
"reconnect=1 timeout=0 do-retransmission=false ! application/x-rtp ! "
"decodebin3 ! queue max-size-buffers=1 leaky=2 ! videoconvert ! "
"video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink sync=false``"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:31 3e7c054594c9425581f6093667e6304e
msgid "Pop-Out or within Map"
msgstr "弹出窗口或地图内嵌显示"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:37 f276691c98b64756957237b19797fec4
msgid ""
"To display video in a pop-out window or within the Data screen's map area:"
msgstr "如需在弹出窗口或数据界面的地图区域内显示视频："

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:39 adff983d4f394b6abe682004fd23ec71
msgid ""
"Right-mouse-button click on the Data screen's map area and select Gimbal "
"Video, and then \"Full Sized\", \"Mini\" or \"Pop Out\""
msgstr "在数据界面的地图区域右键单击，选择「Gimbal Video」，然后选择「Full Sized」、「Mini」或「Pop Out」"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:40 e8d817cc9a3345b08721d11ead99aba9
msgid "An new window or portion of the map view should display \"No Video\""
msgstr "新窗口或地图视图的一部分应显示「No Video」"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:41 dfc0a887261041f6b8d07b326dade01e
msgid ""
"Right-mouse-button click on \"No Video\" to display the menu and select "
"\"Video Stream\" to display the \"VideoStreamSelector\" window"
msgstr "在「No Video」上单击鼠标右键以显示菜单，选择「Video Stream」以打开「VideoStreamSelector」窗口"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:47 07728e274b2a468caa6c8f609bd507bc
msgid ""
"The \"Detected Streams\" drop-down will be populated if the autopilot or "
"camera gimbal is publishing the `VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION>`__ "
"mavlink message"
msgstr ""
"若飞控或摄像头云台正在推送 `VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VIDEO_STREAM_INFORMATION>`__ "
"MAVLink 消息，「Detected Streams」下拉菜单将自动填充"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:49 7cc52daa34084db481d8460be2bb4f76
msgid ""
"Please install the `video-stream-information.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/refs/heads/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/video-"
"stream-information.lua>`__ script on the autopilot and set the VID1_CAMMODEL"
" parameter to the camera being used"
msgstr ""
"请在飞控上安装 `video-stream-information.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/refs/heads/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/video-"
"stream-information.lua>`__ 脚本，并将 VID1_CAMMODEL 参数设置为所使用的摄像头型号"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:50 6306890d9a854d51b32df232674ed058
msgid ""
"Alternatively if the above script cannot be used, fill in the GStreamer "
"pipeline directly.  The pipeline below is known to work for the :ref:`Siyi "
"A8 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` using IP address of '192.168.144.25:8554'"
msgstr ""
"如果无法使用上述脚本，也可直接填写 GStreamer 管道。以下管道已验证可用于 :ref:`Siyi A8 <common-siyi-"
"zr10-gimbal>`，IP 地址为 `192.168.144.25:8554`"

#: ../../source/docs/live-video.rst:54 dc3c02b7275049d9b1d7ccf652896b21
msgid ""
"The gimbal movements can be controlled directly from the live video screen "
"by left-mouse-button clicking on the video or via keyboard shortcuts. These "
"shortcuts can be viewed and changed by right-mouse-button clicking on the "
"video area and selecting Settings"
msgstr "云台动作可通过在实时视频画面上单击鼠标左键或使用键盘快捷键直接控制。可在视频区域右键单击并选择「Settings」来查看和修改这些快捷键。"
